Portions of src/protocol.mjs and src/schema.mjs are adapted from
magpie-claudeweb2api v0.1.3:
https://github.com/mu-zi-lee/magpie-claudeweb2api
Commit: 9fed0935012c2ae2f10871b69fea365126135462
Tool protocol test cases are adapted from its test/protocol.test.mjs.
The process bridge, pipe lifecycle, account guard, conversation bindings and
integration harness follow the sibling's architecture, reimplemented in Node.

backend/turn.mjs uses the multilingual rate-limit detection approach described
in codex-chatgpt-web's browser-worker.ts at commit
7cc8b8d8aadbbf729bd2bd43ca47fa15ea9965c0:
https://github.com/miuuyy/codex-chatgpt-web
No markdown buffer or engine was copied. Its notice is retained below.

